o, insieme. \nVi voglio bene, Carla.", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gF_eSVyorCgNZ4jvpeo8zZzDlCQ1dYD11Mye2uKPdPRReshBds1pcGv5UsKMcfJQp0&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEwpMSc&_nc_gid=qWzaA0yI639smNAs04xVQQ&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af_kjrjF37sIwfGQuMF6cIz6XVabLHAw_DG_ZOH-Wkc0nQ&oe=6A2632AC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "And with this video we close the series \"tour memories\".\nAs I told you in the stories the show was very long and without intervals, so we thought to break it all with this gag moment that made us accomplices and united in telling an evolution of Italian music that never happened. Thank you for playing with me during these twenty dates, let's hope to do it again, soon, together.\nI love you, Carla."}, "comment_count": 1998, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "play_count": 2059860, "ig_play_count": 2059860, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "video_duration": 501.1780090332031, "is_dash_eligible": 1, "video_dash_manifest": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<MPD xmlns=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011 DASH-MPD.xsd\" profiles=\"urn:mpeg:dash:profile:isoff-on-demand:2011\" minBufferTime=\"PT2S\" type=\"static\" mediaPresentationDuration=\"PT501.17803955078125S\" FBManifestTi